    <div class="awsdocs-container">
    <div style="display:none;">
        <header class="awsdocs-page-header">
            <h1 class="awsdocs-page-title">AWS Key Management Service Documentation</h1>
            <div class="awsdocs-page-abstract">AWS Key Management Service (AWS KMS) is an encryption and key management service scaled for the cloud. AWS KMS keys and functionality are used by other AWS services, and you can use them to protect data in your own applications that use AWS.</div>
        </header>
        <main class="awsdocs-main">
            <section class="awsdocs-section" aria-labelledby="">
                <div class="awsdocs-cards" data-component="Grid" data-grid-definition="[{&quot;colspan&quot;:{&quot;xxs&quot;:6,&quot;m&quot;:4}}]">
                    <article class="awsdocs-card">
                        <a href="/kms/latest/developerguide/" class="awsdocs-card-link">
                            <h3 class="awsdocs-card-title">Developer Guide</h3>
                            <div class="awsdocs-abstract"> Provides conceptual overviews of AWS Key Management Service and explains how to use it to protect data in your own applications that use AWS.</div>
                        </a>
                        <div class="awsdocs-card-footer"></div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="awsdocs-card">
                        <a href="/kms/latest/APIReference/" class="awsdocs-card-link">
                            <h3 class="awsdocs-card-title">API Reference</h3>
                            <div class="awsdocs-abstract"> Describes in detail the API operations for AWS Key Management Service. Also provides sample requests, responses, and errors for the supported web services protocols.</div>
                        </a>
                        <div class="awsdocs-card-footer"></div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="awsdocs-card">
                        <a href="/cli/latest/reference/kms/index.html" class="awsdocs-card-link">
                            <h3 class="awsdocs-card-title">AWS KMS in the AWS CLI Reference</h3>
                            <div class="awsdocs-abstract"> Describes the AWS Key Management Service commands that are available in the AWS Command Line Interface.</div>
                        </a>
                        <div class="awsdocs-card-footer"></div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>
